# ============================================================
#  Npc 网络急救 · .gitignore
#  原则：日志、备份、临时文件、编译中间产物一律不进仓库
# ============================================================

# --- 运行产物 / 日志 / 备份（程序默认写到 C:\ProgramData\NpcNetRepair）---
*.log
report_*.txt
last_verify.json
backup_*/
backup_*
NpcNetRepair_*.log

# --- 临时文件 ---
*.tmp
*.nrtmp
*.bak
~$*
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# --- Windows 垃圾文件 ---
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db
$RECYCLE.BIN/
System Volume Information/

# --- macOS / Linux 垃圾文件 ---
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*

# --- 编辑器 / IDE ---
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# --- 打包 / 压缩产物 ---
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.tar.gz

# --- 本地测试输出 ---
test-output/
out/
dist/

# ============================================================
#  关于 Npc修复网络.exe：
#    当前保留在仓库里，方便普通用户直接点击下载。
#    如果你想“源码与二进制分离”，取消下面这行的注释，
#    改为把 exe 传到 GitHub Releases（见 README / 上传指南）。
# ============================================================
# Npc修复网络.exe
